    comment "en" """
        Source V2911 SNOMED CT 21107000 214640008 is the Swedish 7-character extension of ICD-10 V29.1
        (Passenger injured in collision with other and unspecified motor vehicles in nontraffic
        accident) with an activity suffix (leisure). The activity suffix is administrative registry
        metadata, not a clinical attribute; the accident concept equals parent V29.1. SNOMED CT 434228
        (21107000) = Passenger in vehicular AND/OR traffic accident; SNOMED CT 437738 (214640008) = Motor
        vehicle accident off public road. Both are Athena targets of parent V29.1 (concept 45561188).
        One-level broader (target omits the activity suffix); high tier per parent crosswalk.
        """
}
